                       *********************************> Cloudy 17.03 <**********************************
                       * title CIV QSO                                                                   *
                       * set punch prefix "CIV_QSO"                                                      *
                       * radius = 21.500 23.500                                                          *
                       * iterate to convergence                                                          *
                       * sphere                                                                          *
                       * init "dlaw_HI_exp.ini"                                                          *
                       * table SED "QSO.sed"                                                             *
                       * no line transfer                                                                *
                       * nuL(nu) = 46.0 at 1 Ryd                                                         *
                       * stop temperature off                                                            *
                       * metals 0.1                                                                      *
                       * save last radius ".rad"                                                         *
                       * save last continuum ".cont"                                                     *
                       * save last physical conditions ".phy"                                            *
                       * save last overview ".ovr"                                                       *
                       * save last heating ".heat"                                                       *
